{"site": {"id": "31-tanglin-trust-school", "name": "Tanglin Trust School", "type": "School", "country": "Singapore", "region": "Asia", "curriculum": "British / IB", "ownership": "Non-profit", "url": "https://www.tts.edu.sg", "client": false}, "pages": [{"url": "https://www.tts.edu.sg/", "title": "British International School in Singapore | Tanglin Trust School", "lang": "en-US", "vh": 900, "blocks": [[18, "a", -54, 1, 0, "Skip To Main Content"], [18, "span", -10000, 1, 1, "Tanglin Trust School"], [60, "div", 776, 1, 1, "GENERATIONS OF EXCELLENCE"], [50, "h1", 1026, 0, 0, "Home"], [45, "h2", 1220, 0, 1, "Welcome to Tanglin Trust"], [16, "h4", 1194, 0, 1, "A MESSAGE FROM CRAIG CONSIDINE, CEO"], [25, "p", 1294, 0, 0, "At Tanglin, school life is not simply preparation for something in the future. Every day of a child’s school life is important and should be looked forward to with excitement and anticipation. Each child is unique and their needs change as they grow. Knowing them, inspiring them, caring for them, challenging them and collaborating with them is our work. This responsibility requires a purposeful and creative approach that respects everyone's needs. Individuals matter as do communal experiences that create camaraderie and connectedness ..."], [16, "h2", 2192, 0, 1, "Infant School"], [14, "p", 2225, 0, 0, "(Start of Primary School) AGE 3 - 7"], [15, "p", 2302, 0, 0, "We are the first school in Asia to be awarded a Curiosity Approach® accredited status."], [16, "h2", 2192, 0, 1, "Junior School"], [14, "p", 2225, 0, 0, "(Continuation of Primary School) AGE 7 - 11"], [15, "p", 2302, 0, 0, "We develop our children's potential so they can achieve their own 'personal best', regardless of their starting point."], [16, "h2", 2192, 0, 1, "Middle School"], [14, "p", 2225, 0, 0, "(Start of Secondary School) AGE 11 - 14"], [15, "p", 2302, 0, 0, "We nurture students to develop a deeper understanding of our core values of Curiosity, Confidence and Community whilst learning how to..."], [16, "h2", 2192, 0, 1, "Upper School"], [14, "p", 2225, 0, 0, "(Continuation of Secondary School) AGE 14 -16"], [15, "p", 2330, 0, 0, "With a wide array of (I) GCSE subjects from multiple exam boards, our Upper School curriculum ensures a rigorous and broad academic experience."], [16, "h2", 2192, 0, 1, "Sixth Form"], [14, "p", 2225, 0, 0, "(Culmination of Secondary School) Ages 16 - 18"], [15, "p", 2302, 0, 0, "We are the only school in Singapore who offer a dual pathway of either A-level or the International Baccalaureate Diploma."], [45, "h2", 2468, 0, 1, "Featured News"], [16, "h4", 2439, 0, 1, "STAY INFORMED"], [25, "div", 2629, 0, 0, "Tanglin Celebrates Outstanding 2026 IB..."], [16, "p", 2721, 0, 0, "Tanglin’s 2026 IB results are highly impressive. One of the largest IB cohorts to graduate from Tanglin achieved a 100% pass rate with a provisional average diploma score of..."], [16, "div", 2888, 0, 0, "Read More"], [16, "span", -157097, 1, 0, "about Tanglin Celebrates Outstanding 2026 IB Results"], [25, "div", 2629, 0, 0, "2026 (I)GCSEs: An Impressive Set of Results"], [16, "p", 2721, 0, 0, "This year’s cohort has achieved a fantastic set of GCSE results, maintaining the high standards achieved by last year’s students. With an impressive 92% of grades awarded at..."], [16, "span", -157097, 1, 0, "about 2026 (I)GCSEs: An Impressive Set of Results"], [25, "div", 2629, 0, 0, "2026 A Level Results Reflect Students' Effort..."], [16, "p", 2721, 0, 0, "Tanglin Trust School is celebrating excellent A Level results, with 63% of all grades awarded at A* or A, exceeding the average of 28.7 %* achieved by students in England."], [16, "div", 2721, 0, 0, "..."], [16, "span", -157097, 1, 0, "about 2026 A Level Results Reflect Students' Effort and Dedication"], [25, "div", 3018, 0, 0, "Spears Schools Index 2026 - Top 100 Private Schools..."], [16, "p", 3110, 0, 0, "For the 5th year in a row Spears has named Tanglin one of the top 100 private schools in the world, and among the top 15 in Asia Pacific."], [16, "span", -156736, 1, 0, "about Spears Schools Index 2026 - Top 100 Private Schools in the World (opens in new window/tab)"], [25, "div", 3004, 0, 0, "2025 British Schools Overseas (BSO)..."], [16, "p", 3096, 0, 0, "Tanglin is the only international school in Singapore to be inspected by British Schools Overseas (BSO). Their most recent inspection just completed, and we are pleased to have been rated, once..."], [16, "span", -156722, 1, 0, "about 2025 British Schools Overseas (BSO) Inspection - Tanglin Rated Outstanding"], [25, "div", 3018, 0, 0, "Three Gold awards in the HoneyKids Singapore..."], [16, "p", 3110, 0, 0, "For the 2nd year in a row Tanglin has been named International School of the Year in the 2025 HoneyKids Singapore Education awards."], [16, "span", -156736, 1, 0, "about Three Gold awards in the HoneyKids Singapore Education Awards 2025"], [45, "h2", 3782, 0, 1, "School Master Plan Development Project"], [16, "h4", 3756, 0, 1, "PLANNING OUR FUTURE"], [16, "p", 3910, 0, 0, "With Tanglin Trust School’s Portsdown Road home secured until 2056, our Master Plan Development Project marks an exciting new chapter - creating exceptional spaces for learning, growth and community, while investing confidently in generations of students to come."], [45, "h2", 4539, 0, 1, "The Tanglin Highlands Programme"], [16, "p", 4480, 0, 1, "Awarded Curriculum Initiative of the Year for Tes Awards for International Schools 2025"], [16, "p", 4667, 0, 0, "We’re committed to providing a holistic education that values not only academic success but also wellbeing and active participation in co-curricular life. Now in its third year, the Tanglin Highlands Programme at our Gippsland campus in Australia offers Year 9 students a transformative five-week immersive experience. Set in a safe and supportive environment, the programme encourages students to step outside their comfort zones, build resilience, and grow both personally and socially."], [45, "h2", 5195, 0, 1, "Hear from our Alumni"], [16, "h4", 5169, 0, 1, "TANGLIN ALUMNI"], [16, "p", 5269, 0, 0, "Tanglin Alumni is made up of former students, staff, and parents who have all contributed to the rich heritage of Tanglin Trust School – the oldest British International School in South East Asia. As a not-for-profit school, we recently celebrated our Centenary Year, marking 100 Years of Generations of Excellence . Throughout this milestone, we honoured the lasting impact of our alumni community and continue to celebrate their achievements and contributions to Tanglin's story."], [45, "h2", 5903, 0, 1, "Work at Tanglin"], [16, "h4", 5877, 0, 1, "EMPLOYMENT OPPORTUNITIES"], [16, "p", 5977, 0, 0, "Founded in 1925, Tanglin Trust School is one of Asia’s most respected, non-profit international schools. Combining the best of British international education with a global outlook, we foster a culture of innovation, intellectual inquiry, and holistic development."], [16, "p", 6109, 0, 0, "Tanglin Trust is proud to have been named as one of Singapore’s Best Employers, a ranking of the top 200 companies and institutions with at least 200 employees. We are an equal opportunities employer committed to the ongoing professional development of all our staff."], [16, "p", 6643, 0, 0, "\"Tanglin has delivered beyond our expectations. The Infant, Junior and now Senior School - has provided a truly nurturing environment, supporting our children at every step of their learning journey. \" The Martin-Sperry Family (June, 2026)"], [45, "h2", 6677, 0, 1, "Generations of Excellence"], [16, "h4", 6651, 0, 1, "TESTIMONIALS"], [16, "p", 6751, 0, 0, "Tanglin has a well-established history of excellence in education. Read what our parents, employees and students have to say about us (click arrows below)."], [18, "a", 7327, 0, 1, "Is Tanglin Trust School a non-profit organisation?"], [18, "a", 7383, 0, 1, "What does the 2025 \"Outstanding\" BSO rating mean?"], [18, "a", 7439, 0, 1, "Does Tanglin offer both A-Levels and the IB Diploma?"], [18, "a", 7495, 0, 1, "How does the Tanglin Waitpool system work?"], [18, "a", 7551, 0, 1, "How far in advance should I apply for a place at Tanglin?"], [18, "div", 8478, 0, 0, "Powered by Finalsite"]], "links": [["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/policies/cookie-policy", "Learn More"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/main", "ABOUT TANGLIN"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/main", "About Tanglin"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/mission-vision", "Mission & Vision"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/the-tanglin-ten", "The Tanglin Ten"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/history-of-the-school", "History of the School"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/academic-results", "Academic Results"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/graduate-pathways", "Graduate Profiles"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/inspections-awards", "Inspections & Awards"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/interactive-campus-map", "Interactive Campus Map"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/tanglin-master-plan-development-project/home", "Tanglin Master Plan Development Project"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/governance", "Governance"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/contact-us", "Contacts & Directions"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/safeguarding-child-protection", "Safeguarding & Child Protection"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/sustainability", "Environment & Sustainability"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/our-dei-commitment", "Our DEI Commitment"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/main", "ABOUT TANGLIN"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/main", "About Tanglin"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/mission-vision", "Mission & Vision"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/the-tanglin-ten", "The Tanglin Ten"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/history-of-the-school", "History of the School"], ["https://www.