 1, 0, "Mission & Vision"], [24, "h2", 468, 1, 1, "Tanglin Mission"], [18, "p", 517, 1, 0, "Tanglin Trust School in Singapore has a long tradition of providing British-based learning with an international perspective. At Tanglin we strive to make every individual feel valued, happy and successful. Responsibility, enthusiasm and participation are actively encouraged, and integrity is prized. Working together in a safe, caring yet stimulating environment, we set high expectations whilst offering strong support, resulting in a community of lifelong learners who can contribute with confidence to our world."], [24, "h2", 761, 1, 1, "Tanglin Vision Statement"], [18, "p", 810, 1, 0, "We aspire to be the best school in the world with a dynamic learning community which nurtures and inspires every individual to be the best they can be."], [24, "h2", 908, 0, 1, "Tanglin's Next Chapter of Global Excellence"], [24, "h2", 1735, 0, 1, "Core Values"], [24, "h2", 2020, 0, 0, "Respect"], [18, "p", 2069, 0, 0, "We treat others as we would want to be treated ourselves."], [18, "p", 2147, 0, 0, "We value our parent community and encourage their participation in school."], [18, "p", 2225, 0, 0, "Tanglin is a community where everyone is valued and included."], [24, "h2", 2020, 0, 0, "Responsibility"], [18, "p", 2069, 0, 0, "Tanglin seeks to act ethically and according to the principles of social and environmental responsibility."], [18, "p", 2176, 0, 0, "We value teachers who learn and learners who teach."], [18, "p", 2254, 0, 0, "We value the opportunity for all to take risks, learn from mistakes, express themselves, and reflect on life and learning."], [24, "h2", 2020, 0, 0, "Purpose"], [18, "p", 2069, 0, 0, "We are driven by our desire to teach students how to enjoy learning, playing, and making friends."], [18, "p", 2176, 0, 0, "We allow students time and space to be who they are and discover who they might become."], [18, "p", 2283, 0, 0, "We celebrate students' personal fulfilment, 