irst or second-choice universities, which are amongst the best in the world."], [18, "p", 1655, 0, 0, "Tanglin won three Golds in the Singapore Education Awards for the second year running in the following categories:"], [18, "li", 1730, 0, 0, "Singapore International School of the Year"], [18, "li", 1759, 0, 0, "International School with the Most Future-Ready Students"], [18, "li", 1788, 0, 0, "The Curriculum Awards (British)"], [17, "h2", 2278, 0, 1, "MISSION & VISION"], [18, "p", 2319, 0, 0, "At Tanglin we strive to make every individual feel valued, happy and successful."], [17, "h2", 2278, 0, 1, "HISTORY OF THE SCHOOL"], [18, "p", 2319, 0, 0, "With over 100 years experience, Tanglin has a well-established history of excellence in education."], [17, "h2", 2278, 0, 1, "ACADEMIC RESULTS"], [18, "p", 2319, 0, 0, "As the only International school in Singapore to offer dual pathway, we are proud of our students exceptional performances in both A Levels and IB..."], [17, "h2", 2568, 0, 1, "INSPECTIONS & AWARDS"], [18, "p", 2609, 0, 0, "All three schools are judged to be ‘Outstanding’, the highest possible grade. See also the various awards and..."], [17, "h2", 2568, 0, 1, "INTERACTIVE CAMPUS MAP"], [18, "p", 2609, 0, 0, "Tanglin’s facilities have transformed over the years as new buildings and the latest technologies have been introduced to support our growing student body."], [17, "h2", 2568, 0, 1, "GOVERNANCE"], [18, "p", 2609, 0, 0, "Meet our board of governors and the appointed committees in relation to different areas of responsibility."], [55, "h2", 2798, 0, 1, "100"], [16, "p", 2856, 0, 0, "Years of Establishment"], [16, "div", 2856, 0, 0, "Student Nationalities"], [55, "h2", 2798, 0, 1, "674"], [16, "p", 2856, 0, 0, "No. of Employees"], [55, "h2", 2798, 0, 1, "270"], [16, "p", 2856, 0, 0, "Teaching Staff"], [55, "h2", 2958, 0, 1, "722"], [16, "p", 3016, 0, 0, "Infant Children (Nursery to Year 2)"], [55, "h2", 2958, 0, 1, "773"], [16, "p", 3016, 0, 0, "Junior Children (Year 3 to 6)"], [55, "h2", 2958, 0, 1, "1334"], [16, "div", 3016, 0, 0, "Senior Students (Year 7 to 13)"], [55, "h2", 2958, 0, 1, "22K +"], [16, "p", 3016, 0, 0, "Alumni"], [24, "h2", 3276, 0, 0, "Discover our Infant School"], [14, "p", 3574, 0, 0, "Learn More"], [24, "h2", 3276, 0, 0, "Discover our Junior School"], [24, "h2", 3276, 0, 0, "Discover our Sixth Form"], [22, "p", 3855, 0, 0, "More than 50 nationalities are educated across the Tanglin Trust and the ‘school within school’ model gives the feel of a more intimate experience than the numbers would suggest. It features impressive technology and is also one of the top schools locally for results."], [14, "cite", 3974, 0, 0, "Spear's 500 Top 15 China and SEA Schools (2021)"], [18, "div", 5003, 0, 0, "Powered by Finalsite"]], "links": [["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/policies/cookie-policy", "Learn More"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/main", "Skip To Main Content"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/main", "ABOUT TANGLIN"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/main", "About Tanglin"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/mission-vision", "Mission & Vision"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/the-tanglin-ten", "The Tanglin Ten"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/history-of-the-school", "History of the School"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/academic-results", "Academic Results"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/graduate-pathways", "Graduate Profiles"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/inspections-awards", "Inspections & Awards"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/interactive-campus-map", "Interactive Campus Map"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/tanglin-master-plan-development-project/home", "Tanglin Master Plan Development Project"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/governance", "Governance"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/contact-us", "Contacts & Directions"], ["https://www.tts.edu.sg/about-tanglin/safeguarding-child-